ature changes from all three phases:\n\n$$\n-6 \\text{ (low)} + (-12) \\text{ (high)} + 4 \\text{ (off)} = -14 \\text{ degrees}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Final temperature\nThe final temperature is:\n\n$$\nT + (-14) = T - 14\n$$\n\nSo, the final temperature is **14 degrees lower** than the starting temperature.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{14}\n$$\n\nThe final temperature is **14 degrees lower** than the starting temperature.", "decode_seconds": 2.9379771882668138, "draft_calls": 80, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 115, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "a53b21494b39f7139d3a04b206a5698dbf22fbd0fa7192f8f9cc577bcf4a59e9", "method": "relay_two", "output_hash": "ba8f14e1e3e3488b5ba3371376e2a43efde116e54de4ccaff7fdc532c56824c0", "output_tokens": 458, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23602678784, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23873978368, "problem_id": "gsm8k/569fe2a067082d1d", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 501.45472049713135, "prefill_full_target": 46.189537048339844, "prefill_relay": 0.14582400023937225, "relay": 15.071039974689484, "unattributed_runtime": 32.92777472734451, "verification_full_target": 2390.342784881592}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "14", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.9861316811293364, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23873978368, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23806869504, "target_calls": 80, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0463977032341063, "turn_index": 0}
