9% of its total capacity per hour**.\n- For the next **3 hours**, it **loses 7% of its total capacity per hour**.\n- After these 8 hours, the **remaining charge is 28%** of the total capacity.\n\nSo, the **charge remaining after 8 hours** is:\n\n$$\nx \\times (1 - 0.09)^5 \\times (1 - 0.07)^3 = 0.28\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Plug in the values\n\nWe can now write the equation:\n\n$$\nx \\times (0.91)^5 \\times (0.93)^3 = 0.28\n$$\n\nLet\u2019s compute the constants:\n\n- $ (0.91)^5 \\approx 0.6240 $\n- $ (0.93)^3 \\approx 0.8044 $\n\nSo:\n\n$$\nx \\times 0.6240 \\times 0.8044 = 0.28\n$$\n\n$$\nx \\times 0.5023 = 0.28\n$$\n\n$$\nx = \\frac{0.28}{0.5023} \\approx 0.5575\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Interpret the result\n\nSo, the **initial charge when Maria left for the park** was approximately **55.75%** of the total capacity.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{55.75\\%}\n$$\n\nSo, the **charge of the power bank when Maria went out to the park was approximately 55.75%** of its total capacity.", "decode_seconds": 4.942212572321296, "draft_calls": 134, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 147, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "1731be3c1200b11f669250c83273ab1eb2ec82552d7e1ee06d5b99f852706a1c", "method": "relay_one", "output_hash": "5cc475f6879abcee0ee8a2617e178240f18c6040d6e1464fe27d8f5d57a48419", "output_tokens": 602, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23635137536, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23915921408, "problem_id": "gsm8k/55a162e4b38af59a", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 837.8639054298401, "prefill_full_target": 37.5972785949707, "prefill_relay": 0.09673599898815155, "relay": 24.167840033769608, "unattributed_runtime": 53.5232913531363, "verification_full_target": 4028.4019832611084}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 1